採点には現時点で使っていません（変化イベントを蓄積し、効果を検証してから判断します）。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"48.9\" width=\"320\" height=\"17.699999999999996\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,32.7 9.1,22.1 14.2,48.2 19.3,51.2 24.5,22.4 29.6,38.6 34.7,27.6 39.8,36.9 44.9,44.6 50.0,35.8 55.1,27.0 60.3,23.9 65.4,25.9 70.5,19.6 75.6,12.8 80.7,27.7 85.8,28.6 91.0,34.7 96.1,29.2 101.2,35.5 106.3,33.9 111.4,34.7 116.5,36.3 121.6,31.5 126.8,32.0 131.9,41.4 137.0,46.7 142.1,48.8 147.2,45.0 152.3,53.2 157.4,55.3 162.6,62.7 167.7,68.4 172.8,73.6 177.9,77.3 183.0,72.3 188.1,77.0 193.2,94.9 198.4,84.8 203.5,85.2 208.6,79.8 213.7,89.1 218.8,97.2 223.9,77.0 229.0,73.6 234.2,77.3 239.3,73.7 244.4,55.3 249.5,58.3 254.6,55.4 259.7,71.5 264.9,54.2 270.0,48.6 275.1,61.9 280.2,66.9 285.3,69.1 290.4,62.2 295.5,79.8 300.7,84.4 305.8,77.3 310.9,73.1 316.0,71.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 44.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 44.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 44.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 19.3 63.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 39.8 48.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 111.4 46.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"